flowchart TD
    subgraph CI["GitHub Actions"]
        PR["Pull request: selective affected-area gates<br/>no secrets, never publishes"]
        Main["Trusted main: complete integration<br/>build, scan, SBOM"]
        GHCR["Publish immutable multi-arch image to GHCR<br/>commit SHA + content digest, never latest"]
        PR --> Main --> GHCR
    end

    Dispatch["Owner dispatches promotion on main<br/>explicit CI run/attempt, source SHA and digest"]
    Evidence["Verify trusted-main quality/security/publication evidence"]
    Approval["Owner approves protected dev environment"]
    Connect["Ephemeral Tailscale + restricted OpenSSH<br/>installed/runtime contract and source-trust checks"]

    subgraph Deploy["Existing deploy-private-dev on vgpdev (one host lock)"]
        Verify["Verify supplied revision and digest<br/>pull by digest, check OCI labels"]
        Migrate["Run the image once as the migration actor"]
        Replace["Replace only the application container<br/>with the selected digest"]
        Ready{"Candidate ready?"}
        Smoke["Deployment smoke over the private HTTPS edge<br/>browser build identity, releases, OIDC session, telemetry"]
        Record["Record JSON evidence: success or failure + phase"]
        Verify --> Migrate --> Replace --> Ready
        Ready -->|yes| Smoke --> Record
        Ready -->|no| Record
    end

    GHCR --> Dispatch --> Evidence --> Approval --> Connect --> Verify
    Manual["Owner manual deployment / assessed recovery"] --> Verify
    Runtime["Separate owner-reviewed runtime/dependency rollout<br/>and installed-contract acknowledgement"] -. prerequisite if contracts changed .-> Connect
    Migrate -->|migration fails: previous application keeps running| Record
    Record -->|failure| Assess["Assess rollback vs forward fix<br/>an applied migration is never reverted"]
    Assess -->|schema-compatible| Verify
    Assess -->|forward fix| PR
